.SUBCKT 150_45_MPPT PV+ PV- Batt+ Batt-
+ PARAMS: VOUT=48 EFF=0.95 IIN_MAX=10

* --- Output voltage regulation (ideal)
BREG Batt+ Batt- V = {VOUT}

* --- Measure output current
B_IOUT IOUT 0 I = V(Batt+, Batt-)/1

* --- Output power
B_POUT POUT 0 V = V(Batt+, Batt-)*I(IOUT)

* --- Required input current (with efficiency)
B_IIN PV+ PV- I = LIMIT( V(POUT)/(EFF*V(PV+,PV-)), 0, IIN_MAX )

.ENDS 150_45_MPPT